<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>우리집 한 달 식비 자동조절 계산기</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#f7f8fa;--card:#fff;--text:#17191f;--muted:#6b7280;--border:#e5e7eb;--accent:#2563eb;--good:#16a34a;--warn:#d97706;--bad:#dc2626;--c1:#2563eb;--c2:#7c3aed;--c3:#ea580c;--c4:#db2777;--c5:#0891b2}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI","Noto Sans KR",Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.55}.wrap{max-width:980px;margin:auto;padding:24px 16px 48px}.panel,.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px}.panel{padding:18px;margin-top:14px}.card{padding:14px}h1{font-size:28px;margin:0 0 8px}h2{font-size:18px;margin:0}.muted{color:var(--muted)}.tiny{font-size:12px}.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px}.grid{display:grid;gap:12px}.g2{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.g3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}.g4{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.g5{grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr))}@media(max-width:820px){.g4,.g5{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.g3{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:560px){.g2,.g4,.g5{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:24px}.metric{font-size:22px!important}}label{font-size:14px;font-weight:600}input,select,button{font:inherit}input,select{width:100%;min-height:46px;margin-top:6px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:0 12px;background:#fff;color:var(--text)}input[type=range]{border:none;padding:0;background:transparent}button{min-height:44px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:9px 14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.top-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:14px 0}.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.metric{font-size:26px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em}.bar{height:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf0f4;overflow:hidden;margin-top:8px}.fill{height:100%;border-radius:999px;transition:width .2s}.c1{background:var(--c1)}.c2{background:var(--c2)}.c3{background:var(--c3)}.c4{background:var(--c4)}.c5{background:var(--c5)}.status-good{border-left:5px solid var(--good)}.status-warn{border-left:5px solid var(--warn)}.status-bad{border-left:5px solid var(--bad)}.hidden{display:none!important}.radio-box{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:14px;cursor:pointer}.radio-box input{width:auto;min-height:auto;margin-top:3px}.section-gap{margin-top:14px}.hint{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);min-height:18px;margin-top:4px}.badge{display:inline-block;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#eff6ff;color:#2563eb;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.warn-text{font-size:13px;color:var(--bad);margin-top:8px}.footer-note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
<h1>우리집 한 달 식비 자동조절 계산기</h1>
<p class="lead">가족 수와 실제 지출을 넣으면 남은 하루 예산, 월말 예상 식비, 배달·외식 가능 횟수, 1년 절약액까지 자동 계산합니다.</p>
<div class="top-actions"><button id="sampleBtn" type="button">예시값 불러오기</button><button id="clearBtn" type="button">입력값 전체 초기화</button></div>
<form id="calcForm">
<section class="panel"><h2>1. 우리 집 기본 설정</h2><p class="muted tiny section-gap">빈칸이어도 괜찮습니다. 필요한 항목부터 입력하면 결과가 자동으로 갱신됩니다.</p>
<div class="grid g3 section-gap">
<label>가족 수<select id="family"><option value="">선택</option><option value="1">1명</option><option value="2">2명</option><option value="3">3명</option><option value="4">4명</option><option value="5">5명</option><option value="6">6명 이상</option></select></label>
<label>월 가구소득 <span class="muted">(선택)</span><input id="income" type="number" min="0" step="10000" placeholder="예: 5000000"><div id="incomeHint" class="hint"></div></label>
<label>오늘 날짜<input id="today" type="number" min="1" max="31" placeholder="예: 15"><div id="dayHint" class="hint"></div></label>
</div>
<div class="section-gap"><div class="muted tiny" style="margin-bottom:8px">이번 달 식비 목표 설정</div><div class="grid g2">
<label class="radio-box"><input type="radio" name="budgetMethod" value="fixed"><span><strong>목표 직접 입력</strong><br><span class="muted tiny">이번 달 식비 한도를 직접 정합니다.</span></span></label>
<label class="radio-box"><input type="radio" name="budgetMethod" value="auto"><span><strong>지난달 기준 자동 설정</strong><br><span class="muted tiny">지난달보다 몇 % 줄일지 정합니다.</span></span></label>
</div></div>
<div id="fixedWrap" class="section-gap hidden"><label>이번 달 목표 식비<input id="target" type="number" min="0" step="10000" placeholder="예: 1200000"><div id="targetHint" class="hint"></div></label><div class="top-actions" style="margin-bottom:0"><button type="button" class="budgetQuick" data-value="800000">80만</button><button type="button" class="budgetQuick" data-value="1000000">100만</button><button type="button" class="budgetQuick" data-value="1200000">120만</button><button type="button" class="budgetQuick" data-value="1500000">150만</button><button type="button" class="budgetQuick" data-value="2000000">200만</button></div></div>
<div id="autoWrap" class="grid g2 section-gap hidden"><label>지난달 총 식비<input id="lastMonth" type="number" min="0" step="10000" placeholder="예: 1400000"><div id="lastHint" class="hint"></div></label><label>이번 달 절감 목표 <strong id="saveRateLabel">10%</strong><input id="saveRate" type="range" min="0" max="30" step="1" value="10"></label></div>
</section>
<section class="panel"><div class="row"><div><h2>2. 이번 달 지금까지 실제 지출</h2><p class="muted tiny section-gap">카드앱이나 가계부 기준으로 대략 입력해도 충분합니다.</p></div><div style="text-align:right"><div class="tiny muted">현재 자동합계</div><div id="currentTotal" style="font-weight:800">0원</div></div></div>
<div class="grid g4 section-gap"><label>장보기·집밥<input id="grocery" type="number" min="0" step="1000" placeholder="0"><div id="groceryHint" class="hint"></div></label><label>배달<input id="delivery" type="number" min="0" step="1000" placeholder="0"><div id="deliveryHint" class="hint"></div></label><label>외식<input id="dining" type="number" min="0" step="1000" placeholder="0"><div id="diningHint" class="hint"></div></label><label>간식·커피<input id="snack" type="number" min="0" step="1000" placeholder="0"><div id="snackHint" class="hint"></div></label></div>
<details class="section-gap"><summary><strong>배달·외식 횟수까지 계산하기</strong></summary><div class="grid g2 section-gap"><label>배달 1회 평균 결제액<input id="avgDelivery" type="number" min="0" step="1000" placeholder="예: 40000"><div id="avgDeliveryHint" class="hint"></div></label><label>가족 외식 1회 평균 결제액<input id="avgDining" type="number" min="0" step="1000" placeholder="예: 80000"><div id="avgDiningHint" class="hint"></div></label></div></details>
</section>
<section class="panel"><div class="row"><div><h2>3. 식비 포트폴리오</h2><p class="muted tiny section-gap">생활패턴에 맞게 항목별 예산을 자동 배분합니다.</p></div><select id="mode" style="max-width:230px"><option value="">선택</option><option value="save">절약형</option><option value="balance">균형형</option><option value="easy">편의형</option><option value="custom">직접 조정</option></select></div><div id="modeSummary" class="section-gap" style="font-weight:700"></div><div id="customWrap" class="grid g5 section-gap hidden"><label>장보기 %<input id="pGrocery" type="number" min="0" max="100"></label><label>배달 %<input id="pDelivery" type="number" min="0" max="100"></label><label>외식 %<input id="pDining" type="number" min="0" max="100"></label><label>간식 %<input id="pSnack" type="number" min="0" max="100"></label><label>예비비 %<input id="pReserve" type="number" min="0" max="100"></label></div><div id="customError" class="warn-text hidden"></div></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>4. 절약 시뮬레이션</h2><p class="muted tiny section-gap">생활 만족도는 유지하면서 딱 몇 가지만 바꿨을 때 효과를 계산해봅니다.</p><div class="grid g3 section-gap"><label>배달 월 <strong id="cutDeliveryLabel">2회</strong> 줄이기<input id="cutDelivery" type="range" min="0" max="8" step="1" value="2"></label><label>외식 월 <strong id="cutDiningLabel">1회</strong> 줄이기<input id="cutDining" type="range" min="0" max="4" step="1" value="1"></label><label>장보기 낭비 <strong id="cutGroceryLabel">5%</strong> 줄이기<input id="cutGrocery" type="range" min="0" max="20" step="1" value="5"></label></div></section>
</form>
<section id="emptyState" class="panel"><strong>먼저 몇 가지만 입력해보세요.</strong><p class="muted tiny section-gap">가족 수, 목표 식비, 현재 지출 정도만 입력해도 핵심 결과를 볼 수 있습니다. 빠르게 체험하려면 ‘예시값 불러오기’를 눌러보세요.</p></section>
<section id="resultArea" class="hidden">
<div id="statusCard" class="panel status-good"><div class="row"><div><div class="tiny muted">이번 달 식비 페이스</div><div id="statusText" class="metric">-</div><div id="statusSub" class="muted tiny"></div></div><div style="text-align:right"><div class="tiny muted">월말 예상 식비</div><div id="forecast" class="metric">-</div><div id="forecastGap" class="tiny muted"></div></div></div><div class="bar"><div id="mainProgress" class="fill c1" style="width:0%"></div></div><div class="row tiny muted"><span id="spentLabel"></span><span id="targetLabel"></span></div></div>
<div class="grid g5 section-gap"><div class="card"><div class="tiny muted">남은 식비</div><div id="remaining" class="metric">-</div></div><div class="card"><div class="tiny muted">남은 하루 한도</div><div id="daily" class="metric">-</div></div><div class="card"><div class="tiny muted">1인 하루 목표</div><div id="perPerson" class="metric">-</div></div><div class="card"><div class="tiny muted">현재 사용률</div><div id="usedRate" class="metric">-</div></div><div class="card"><div class="tiny muted">소득 대비 목표 식비</div><div id="incomeRatio" class="metric">-</div></div></div>
<div class="grid g2 section-gap"><div class="card"><strong>🍱 앞으로 배달 가능 횟수</strong><div id="deliveryLeft" class="metric">-</div><div id="deliveryNote" class="tiny muted"></div></div><div class="card"><strong>🍽️ 앞으로 외식 가능 횟수</strong><div id="diningLeft" class="metric">-</div><div id="diningNote" class="tiny muted"></div></div></div>
<div class="panel"><div class="row"><div><h2>카테고리별 자동 예산</h2><p class="tiny muted section-gap">현재 사용액과 이번 달 항목별 한도를 함께 보여줍니다.</p></div><div id="portfolioTotal" style="font-weight:700"></div></div><div id="portfolioRows" class="section-gap"></div></div>
<div class="panel"><h2>이번 달 이렇게 해보세요</h2><div id="actions" class="grid g3 section-gap"></div></div>
<div class="panel"><div class="row"><div><h2>절약 시뮬레이션 결과</h2><p class="tiny muted section-gap">선택한 행동을 한 달 동안 유지했을 때의 단순 추정치입니다.</p></div><div style="text-align:right"><div class="tiny muted">1년 예상 절감액</div><div id="annualSaving" class="metric">-</div></div></div><div class="grid g3 section-gap"><div class="card"><div class="tiny muted">한 달 예상 절감</div><div id="monthlySaving" class="metric">-</div></div><div class="card"><div class="tiny muted">절감 후 예상 식비</div><div id="afterSaving" class="metric">-</div></div><div class="card"><div class="tiny muted">현재 페이스의 연간 목표 차이</div><div id="paceAnnual" class="metric">-</div></div></div></div>
<div class="panel"><h2>한눈에 보는 우리 집 식비 진단</h2><div id="diagnosis" class="section-gap"></div></div>
<div class="footer-note">※ 본 계산기는 가계 관리용 시뮬레이션입니다. 가족 구성, 지역, 외식 습관, 식사량에 따라 적정 식비는 크게 달라질 수 있으며 포트폴리오 비율은 정부의 공식 권장기준이 아닙니다.</div>
</section>
</div>
<script>
(()=>{const $=id=>document.getElementById(id),qsa=s=>[...document.querySelectorAll(s)],money=n=>Math.round(Number.isFinite(n)?n:0).toLocaleString('ko-KR')+'원',man=n=>{if(!Number.isFinite(n)||n<=0)return'';const v=n/10000;return Number.isInteger(v)?v.toLocaleString('ko-KR')+'만원':v.toFixed(1)+'만원'},num=id=>{const el=$(id);if(!el||el.value==='')return 0;const v=Number(el.value);return Number.isFinite(v)?Math.max(0,v):0},has=id=>$(id)&&$(id).value!=='',clamp=(v,min,max)=>Math.min(max,Math.max(min,v));const now=new Date(),daysInMonth=new Date(now.getFullYear(),now.getMonth()+1,0).getDate();$('today').max=daysInMonth;const presets={save:{grocery:65,delivery:12,dining:13,snack:7,reserve:3,label:'절약형 · 집밥 중심'},balance:{grocery:55,delivery:18,dining:15,snack:8,reserve:4,label:'균형형 · 집밥과 편의의 균형'},easy:{grocery:45,delivery:28,dining:15,snack:8,reserve:4,label:'편의형 · 맞벌이·시간절약 중심'}};
function bm(){const r=document.querySelector('input[name="budgetMethod"]:checked');return r?r.value:''}function targetBudget(){const m=bm();if(m==='fixed')return num('target');if(m==='auto'&&has('lastMonth'))return num('lastMonth')*(1-num('saveRate')/100);return 0}function allocations(){const m=$('mode').value;if(presets[m])return presets[m];if(m==='custom')return{grocery:num('pGrocery'),delivery:num('pDelivery'),dining:num('pDining'),snack:num('pSnack'),reserve:num('pReserve'),label:'직접 조정'};return null}function updateHints(){[['income','incomeHint'],['target','targetHint'],['lastMonth','lastHint'],['grocery','groceryHint'],['delivery','deliveryHint'],['dining','diningHint'],['snack','snackHint'],['avgDelivery','avgDeliveryHint'],['avgDining','avgDiningHint']].forEach(([a,b])=>$(b).textContent=has(a)?man(num(a)):'');$('dayHint').textContent=has('today')?`${daysInMonth}일 중 ${Math.min(num('today'),daysInMonth)}일째 기준`:''}function syncVisibility(){const m=bm();$('fixedWrap').classList.toggle('hidden',m!=='fixed');$('autoWrap').classList.toggle('hidden',m!=='auto');$('customWrap').classList.toggle('hidden',$('mode').value!=='custom')}function clearAll(){qsa('input[type="number"]').forEach(el=>el.value='');qsa('input[type="radio"]').forEach(el=>el.checked=false);$('family').value='';$('mode').value='';$('saveRate').value='10';$('cutDelivery').value='2';$('cutDining').value='1';$('cutGrocery').value='5';recalc()}function loadSample(){$('family').value='4';$('income').value='5000000';$('today').value=String(Math.min(now.getDate(),daysInMonth));document.querySelector('input[name="budgetMethod"][value="fixed"]').checked=true;$('target').value='1200000';$('lastMonth').value='1400000';$('saveRate').value='10';$('grocery').value='360000';$('delivery').value='240000';$('dining').value='120000';$('snack').value='60000';$('avgDelivery').value='40000';$('avgDining').value='80000';$('mode').value='balance';$('pGrocery').value='55';$('pDelivery').value='18';$('pDining').value='15';$('pSnack').value='8';$('pReserve').value='4';$('cutDelivery').value='2';$('cutDining').value='1';$('cutGrocery').value='5';recalc()}function enough(){return targetBudget()>0&&has('today')&&(has('grocery')||has('delivery')||has('dining')||has('snack'))}
function recalc(){syncVisibility();updateHints();$('saveRateLabel').textContent=num('saveRate')+'%';$('cutDeliveryLabel').textContent=num('cutDelivery')+'회';$('cutDiningLabel').textContent=num('cutDining')+'회';$('cutGroceryLabel').textContent=num('cutGrocery')+'%';const spent={grocery:num('grocery'),delivery:num('delivery'),dining:num('dining'),snack:num('snack')},total=spent.grocery+spent.delivery+spent.dining+spent.snack;$('currentTotal').textContent=money(total);const alloc=allocations();if(alloc){const pt=alloc.grocery+alloc.delivery+alloc.dining+alloc.snack+alloc.reserve,bad=$('mode').value==='custom'&&Math.abs(pt-100)>.01;$('customError').classList.toggle('hidden',!bad);$('customError').textContent=bad?`현재 합계 ${pt}%입니다. 합계를 100%로 맞춰주세요.`:'';$('modeSummary').textContent=bad?'':`${alloc.label} · 장보기 ${alloc.grocery}% / 배달 ${alloc.delivery}% / 외식 ${alloc.dining}% / 간식 ${alloc.snack}% / 예비비 ${alloc.reserve}%`}else{$('modeSummary').textContent='';$('customError').classList.add('hidden')}const ready=enough();$('emptyState').classList.toggle('hidden',ready);$('resultArea').classList.toggle('hidden',!ready);if(!ready)return;const target=targetBudget(),family=has('family')?Math.max(1,num('family')):1,day=clamp(num('today')||1,1,daysInMonth),remDays=Math.max(1,daysInMonth-day+1),remain=target-total,forecast=total/day*daysInMonth,elapsed=day/daysInMonth,pace=total/Math.max(1,target*elapsed),income=num('income'),safeAlloc=alloc&&Math.abs((alloc.grocery+alloc.delivery+alloc.dining+alloc.snack+alloc.reserve)-100)<.01?alloc:presets.balance,budgets={grocery:target*safeAlloc.grocery/100,delivery:target*safeAlloc.delivery/100,dining:target*safeAlloc.dining/100,snack:target*safeAlloc.snack/100,reserve:target*safeAlloc.reserve/100},avgDel=num('avgDelivery'),avgDin=num('avgDining'),delRoom=Math.max(0,budgets.delivery-spent.delivery),dinRoom=Math.max(0,budgets.dining-spent.dining),delOrders=avgDel>0?Math.floor(delRoom/avgDel):null,dinOrders=avgDin>0?Math.floor(dinRoom/avgDin):null;